Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're losing our dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That maniac fused the\NStratum Lords together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing they're on their\Nway to the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.65,0:00:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fly if you have wings, and\Nrun if you're fleet-footed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the Empire and nearby towns\Nand villages what's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We intend to follow them,\Nbut what about your group?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on us to take\Ndown some monster scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Least we can do to pay Boxo\Nback for his sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll gladly risk our\Nlives to aid the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.81,0:00:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we forfeit our man cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:00:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You in, bro? You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let a box be more manly than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must buy some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the sake of Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to stay by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aware I can't atone\Nfor my prior villainy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Personally speaking, I don't think\NI'll ever truly forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.61,0:01:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay behind and help dig\Nup Boxxo. Pity, too. I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying put.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will want to use my magic\Nitems to help with the digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.95,0:01:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing would please me more than to\Nhelp rescue our valiant master, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alas, I'm certain if I don't turn\Nmy blade to slaying monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.27,0:01:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll be angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I tearfully trust this task to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't even need to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing is unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But every last one of us knows\Nhe's still alive out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.57,0:02:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back of\Nmy super strong partner, Llamas.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.76,0:02:22.80,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,했
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah Yeah Yeah Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.04,0:03:33.46,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,1)\fscx87\pos(477,55.4)}As an Apprentice
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've already overtaken\Nthe monster's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Akar's speed never ceases to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's a good omen that\Nit hasn't disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would seem to suggest that our\Nfriend Boxo is still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What of the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope my sister is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really hauling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't take long to reach\Nthe fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:03:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a week tops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since we can't risk entering\Nthe aptly named Murderous Forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our foes will undoubtedly cut through,\Nwith that enormous beast leading the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll charge into the murderous\Nforest and keep the dastards busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With luck, that'll buy\Nus the time we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of idea's a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you so eager to lose your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.77,0:04:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would displease\NMaster Boxxo if I did so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess there's no getting through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swear to me on Boxo's honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you'll return to our ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.47,0:04:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still alive and kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you better get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember to value your\Nlife above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I second the motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living is vastly preferable to dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cherish your life along with your boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If things get hairy, make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only cowards lurk in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find it exhilarating that\Nyou can sense my presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.23,0:05:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recall what my name was\Nbefore I was a bag of bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter anymore, as I now\Nanswer to four-fingered general.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to find one\Nof the five-finger generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say only a master\Nswordsman could have cut
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the bars of the\NPinky General's cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the one to blame?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was called in to clean\Nup the mess she had made.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what joy! What bliss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been an eternity since\Nsomeone blocked my opening strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be quite amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running the right way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The map said the next town's at\Nthe foot of that little mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that's where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry. Oh, wow. Drill-worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village and the veggies are abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even a salad gal, but those greens\Nare calling my name and I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought something could\Nsmell healthy and yummy at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we stuff our faces now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but let's try not to eat at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet other animals want in on it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's dive in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's eat a claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A new experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all juicy and splashes\Naround in my mouth when I bite it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus it has a rich\Nflavor losing with umami!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know what they could\Neat a veggie like thinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine combining these veggies\Nwith the whole lot of fried chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like these veggies even better\Nthan the ones from Kikuyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though they kind of remind me of\Nher stock when I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder what that's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt I'll be able to best him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow this enemy to roam free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lest the friends I left behind\Npay dearly for my failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must end this battle here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're aware my skills surpass your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet you refuse to back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have my reasons for standing strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how fortuitous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had grown weary of cutting down\Nopponents as they flee in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Master Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I'm destined to\Nmeet my end here. And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even as my life slips away from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear to give this final\Nbattle everything I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, a commendable last-ditch effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept this fascinating challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:07:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Essex?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usaka! Usarion! Usarion! Usappi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep our enemy distracted\Nas long as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good sir, please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance to make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.91,0:08:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishel, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to exchange stories later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the time being, our top\Npriority is defeating this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're open to suggestions,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may I ask that you instruct the\NEssex to continue distracting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish. Hey, Usatta!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep whittling away at the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly a valiant effort, Mishuel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.41,0:08:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In truth, I would have been\Ndoomed were it not for the Essex.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, my furry friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Usatta, the head of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The elegant damsel next to him with\Nthe beautiful fluffy coat is Usarion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the tiny versions of them are\Ntheir children, Usarion and Usappi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it that I had no idea you\Nwere an animal trainer, sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're rather powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.53,0:09:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not an animal trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These little fuzzballs\Nare my friends and allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what are you doing\Nin such a dangerous place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could ask the same of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.03,0:09:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the eighth princess\Nof this land, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As there is much to share, I\Nsuggest an exchange of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest, Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been working yourself to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't help Boxxo if you\Nkeel over dead from exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know Boxxo would be mad\Nif he could see you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Boxxo is buried in the dirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That all makes complete sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came from the fortified city when we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.69,0:10:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,caught wind something\Nwas amiss in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The matter of the Guardian\Nhad only just been
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,settled when the dungeon\Nmet with that untimely fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.45,0:10:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He left us to fight the Demon\NLord, but he was badly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.87,0:10:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only recently that we\Nlearned of his whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was able to recover just the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know such a person existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been in the dungeon a good while,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.73,0:10:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so forgive me for being\Nbehind on current events.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's been a long time since I heard any\Nnews about you and I've been worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That whole time, you were in the dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything about your new master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His heart is most sincere and generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He keeps a calm demeanor no matter\Nhow treacherous the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He protects and cares for his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guardian sounds extremely commendable,\Nbut Master Boxxo is utterly magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.41,0:11:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I'll admit Boxo\Nsounds extraordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would be remiss to suggest that he\Ncould possibly surpass the Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my intention to\Nbelittle him, I swear. Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the truth remains that\Nthere isn't a person
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the world who holds\Na candle to Master Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.57,0:11:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guardian is most\Ngenerous and open-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly a being without evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you don't know what\NMaster Boxo is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should save this lively\Ndebate for when our work is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're unable to slow down\Nthe monster army here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear the fortified city\Nwill very soon be overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your friends notifying the city\Ndwellers, there's no cause for concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just to be safe, I'll\Nhelp you set some traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:12:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Usata and the others here,\Nwe can even process timber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you proud, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll distract the fiends without delay and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,buy enough time for you\Nto join us in battle!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.97,0:12:11.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(150,17)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears we'll reach the fortified\Ncity sooner than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I wasn't expecting to behold\Nsuch abundant farmland here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.37,0:12:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city has recently become\Nrenowned for its agriculture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear the impeccable quality of their\Nvegetables is the talk of the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city's lord must be a\Nrather shrewd business person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything useful you can\Ntell us about them, Director?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say she's beautiful and succeeded\Nher father at a young age a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and also, this one's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's best to avoid eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear it's especially\Nrisky for human males.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.95,0:12:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make it sound like we'll fall in\Nlove the moment we lock eyes with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wait is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:13:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lady has arrived and we'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.89,0:13:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and as the ruling lady,\NI welcome all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we finally met our match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.51,0:13:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember her name,\Nbut I know she exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull it together. I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those shoes were orgasmic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feelings for Lady Jessica have\Nreached their climax and been expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, young master...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important that you stop spreading\Nyour charm so indiscriminately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.59,0:13:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as it's causing problems again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.77,0:13:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely agree with Master Stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those eyes can turn\Nhonest men into horndogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's best for everyone\Nif you keep them closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.87,0:14:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're dealing with the\Nforces of the Netherlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or rather the Left-Armed General.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,despite our negotiations\Nwith the Demon Lord's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, but what\Nnegotiations are you referring to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Currently, we're trying\Nto negotiate an armistice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been working on it\Nwith the Demon Lord's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seemed like we were\Nmaking considerable progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Jessica,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Left-Armed General has earned\Nquite the reputation as a schemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning he was trying to seize power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dear Steck,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.59,0:14:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please send a messenger to\Nthe Demon Lord's territory and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let us hope the Guardian returns\Nbefore the enemy reaches us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Motor, explain the situation\Nto our soldiers and citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is what you wish,\Nthen consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted\Nafter your long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me just a moment to\Narrange lodging for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:14:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please help yourself to some fresh\Nvegetables harvested from our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the tastiest-looking\Nvegetables I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm literally drooling like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a delightful feast is worthy\Nof my full attention. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's life-changing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.09,0:15:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just keep on whittling\Nhim down from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She mixed magic with her daughter-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you jabbering on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.11,0:15:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He called me his daughter-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Big Sulream? Yes,\NKai? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world is too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai stole all the Lady\NKiller genes from himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really did!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Boxo's back, we'll guilt him\Ninto teaching us how to up our game!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're speaking my language!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they're already digging\Nhim out and dusting him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe the big luck big\Ntime for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's high time we paid back our debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start by mopping up some monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got your back over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's show them how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our hungry little spears\Nwill dine on monster blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The star attraction has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trainers are in for\Na special treat today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're already aware\NI'm the shouting songstress.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.37,0:16:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, the terrifying and\Ntitillating pinky General Kayolings!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm here to make sure every\None of you suffers and dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm told you were captured\Nbut managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sulream, it feels like it's been forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I never liked you\Nanyway, so no harm, no foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have the pleasure of personally\Nkilling the Ringfinger General.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit, it's a dream, Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the corpses are combining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is quite absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone please\Nexplain what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a necromancer, and\Nshe's in her element.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.57,0:17:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a delicious assortment of monsters and\Nhumans were tragically buried alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm swallowed by a nasty landslide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.69,0:17:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call this my army of rot stitched\Ntogether from fugitive corpses!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because how freakin' metal is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cute you came to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes this easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means I don't have to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,F you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to resist your pathetic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're playing it cool, but it's an act!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got the theatrics, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I know that last attempt must\Nhave drained a crap ton of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.93,0:18:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I finally get to jump\Non that smug little face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make this chick bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to nap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you plopping around?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are your arms and legs\Nturning to you? Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.55,0:18:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since when does the kid have wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how the hell did you decay my army?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.33,0:19:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the dungeon master set about removing\Nmy blessing of decay, I made a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wished to be able to use it at\Nwill instead of losing it completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking out of your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though if you say you're the one\Nto blame, I'll have to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'd let you kill my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's as good a time as any to show off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This crazy lady was just our opening act!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one obstacle\Ndown, but it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looks pretty miffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be hard to get her to\Nunderstand why I kept this from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're running low, I'll\Nchop some more wood for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone's backing muscle,\Ncome help me lift something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put whatever you want on\Nyour tab, so eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.49,0:19:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Munami, you have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.49,0:19:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was worth it, even though it was\Na risk bringing all that seasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Suori, we'll be\Nready to depart shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me know when we're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave as soon as\Nmy things are loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.47,0:20:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters that emerge from the\Ndungeon might still be present.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, it's far too dangerous\Nto leave without a hunter escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need every ounce of\Nmanpower to rebuild this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means we'll just\Nhave to manage on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, I have the utmost faith in\Neveryone we've entrusted with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.23,0:20:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though really,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this will undoubtedly be wasted effort\Nwhen Boxxo inevitably returns to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies, I can't offer\Nany work for a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.81,0:20:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you wish to profit, you\Nshould move to another town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean you're staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the only pounding to do\Nhere is with hammers and nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Shirley, we still\Nowe you for taking us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll follow wherever you lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there isn't a better\Nboss in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such silliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sure, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:21:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll rebuild, then resume our good\Nwork draining lonely men of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear you'll never\Nchange, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.75,0:21:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hurry and save him,\Nbefore he isn't anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.05,0:21:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.11,0:21:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I'm not gonna stop you from\Nsearching, but I won't let you go overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.35,0:21:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a magic item that probes for souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it dig?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't help with labor, but it's possible\Nit can help us locate Bokso's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
