Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.07,0:22:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.03,0:23:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.19,0:23:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you.
